    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging subject for me, especially since it wasn't my strongest area during my education. I appreciate its logical structure and problem-solving aspects, but I often find it abstract and less intuitive compared to subjects like chemistry or art, which I enjoy more. My relationship with math is one of respect and caution—I recognize its importance but prefer to approach it methodically.",
