    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I haven’t used AI tools specifically for math learning recently, but I’ve explored them out of curiosity. While I appreciate their potential to simplify complex problems, I prefer a more hands-on approach where I can work through examples myself. AI could be helpful, but it doesn’t fully replace the satisfaction of solving problems independently.",
